WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.940
Summer Homework
Due at the Start of School on 9/1
NO EXCEPTIONS!

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.550
Summer school was supposed to be more...

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:10.290
relaxed, I thought.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.010
But I'm so exhausted.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.710
I didn't think I'd get 
lectured all day.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.180
That feels good.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.230
Sheesh...

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.660
You hadn't finished the
 homework that was due today.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.560
Of course you're going to get yelled at.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.650
I got them to push the deadline back 
to the first day of school, but...

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.970
Please, Miku! Help me!

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.770
I'll never make it otherwise! 
I won't get it done in time!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.900
You're right. At this rate, you'll be 
lucky to get it in by your birthday,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.990
let alone the first day of school.

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:45.180
Fine. I'll help you.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:49.450
Really? You're a true amigo, Miku!

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.820
Get a room, you two!

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.560
HQ needs us, now!

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.570
What are you saying?

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.040
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.750
I can't hear you—

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.350
Hibiki!

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.630
Miku, I'll be back soon!

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.940
Don't worry!

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:13.340
I'll do my best with both 
my mission and my homework!

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.520
Yeah, I know you will!

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:36.330
Vehicle approaching at high speed!

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:40.590
They decided to attack from land 
to avoid our AA guns, huh?

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:45.580
But they're fools! 
Normal weapons are no match for us!

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:01.840
We have the approaching vehicle
 on the monitor!

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:02.800
That's...

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.930
The enemy is... a Symphogear!

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.060
Don't let her near the AA guns!

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:20.910
<b>Flash of the Rider's Blade - Modified</b>

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:22.150
Ogawa-san!

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:25.170
<i>It's time to fly! (Let's fly!)</i>

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.950
<i>It's time to journey into the sky! 
(Let's fly!)</i>

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.450
<i>To tomorrow!</i>

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:33.410
<i>Bring our voices together as one 
in the greatest symphony of all</i>

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.420
<i>Do you have a dream 
(Let's fight!) in your heart?</i>

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.340
<i>Do you have (Let's fight!) 
a passionate song?</i>

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:45.560
<i>Your overflowing heat explodes</i>

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:50.850
<i>An infinite soul connecting hand in hand</i>

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:55.720
<i>Passionate Chorus Infinity</i>

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:13.580
<i>Pushing it into the red as I jam my fist in</i>

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:19.920
<i>The pure blade of a protector</i>

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:24.800
<i>The reason I feel so safe close to danger</i>

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:31.630
<i>is that I can feel you watching my back</i>

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.640
<b>Fearless Three Blades</b>

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:37.540
<i>So that I won't feel regrets for today, 
which will never come again</i>

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.010
Open fire!

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:42.110
<i>I'll turn even the darkness 
into the power of my heart</i>

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.120
Got 'em!

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:47.660
<i>I'll even clutch tight this 
pain which bites down on me</i>

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:50.430
<i>A song from all (Let's fly!) my spirit</i>

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:53.500
<i>Emotions from all (Let's fly!) my spirit</i>

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:58.700
<i>No matter how far apart we are, 
I swear to you I'll have courage</i>

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:56.260
Retreat!

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.480
<i>Once more (Let's fight!) the wind</i>

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:04.490
<i>Once more (Let's fight!) our resolve</i>

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:07.670
<i>How many tears do you think we shed?</i>

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:10.380
<i>How much blood do you think we shed?</i>

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:15.990
<i>Until we made days that we could call love</i>

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.770
<i>Passionate Chorus Infinity</i>

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.400
Th-This is crazy!

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:27.380
<i></i>

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.380
The enemy has lost 34% of its forces.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:35.470
Watching that movie about fighting 
tanks last night really worked!

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.250
The UN forces are landing in 15 minutes!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:41.010
Disable the enemy's offensive 
capabilities before they arrive!

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:03.440
You're crazy!

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.420
Chris-chan!

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.410
Right.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:15.990
Our defensive line is collapsing! 
We're doomed!

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:17.570
Captain, where are you going?

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.080
What is that?

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:42.220
That thing's huge... and flying!

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:44.360
So that's their main unit...

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.520
Get moving, you guys! Follow them!

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.410
Helicopters, huh?

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:55.630
Then they can't dodge attacks from above!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.290
We did it! We got them all!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:14.910
<i>Even if I go down a million 
times, I'll still be just fine</i>

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:21.090
<i>I've got a reason to rise 
up and leap off the ground</i>

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:19.320
They blocked them with the Symphogears?

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:21.810
Then... we'll fight crazy with crazy!

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:25.850
<i>Offering my songs to a 
million and one heavens</i>

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:32.580
<i>Sharing the answer that can only 
be found when you look ahead</i>

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:38.650
<i>The true enemy is always within your heart</i>

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:43.430
<i>Reflecting on the meaning of having weapons</i>

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:43.050
Tachibana, let Yukine handle the rear!

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:48.750
<i>Strike with extra-large passion!</i>

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.500
<i>Unleash your (Let's fly!) life</i>

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:54.420
<i>To its very (Let's fly!) limits</i>

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:56.390
Get the other helicopters out of here
 while we're holding them off!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.390
<i>An unstoppable resonance</i>

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.810
<i>Telling you to change the world</i>

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.450
<i>The hope I want (Let's fly!) to embrace</i>

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:05.390
<i>The light I want (Let's fly!) to embrace</i>

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:08.690
<i>I know rests within</i>

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.570
<i>arms held outstretched</i>

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.180
<i>I'll never give up, I'll never run away</i>

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.120
<i>Let my sound resonate</i>

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:17.120
No! We won't make it in time!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.360
Let's do it, Kiri-chan!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.500
<i>Passionate Chorus Infinity</i>

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.870
Right!

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:27.500
We can we do it if we try!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.870
We sure can!

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:34.880
<i>When you close your eyes 
and silently wish and pray</i>

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:33.500
I'll finish them off in one blow!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:39.450
<i>You'll turn even the darkness 
into the power of my heart</i>

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:45.530
<i>I'll even clutch tight this 
pain which bites down on me</i>

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:49.280
<i>It's time to fly! (Let's fly!)</i>

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.020
<i>It's time to journey into the sky! 
(Let's fly!)</i>

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.480
<i>To tomorrow!</i>

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:58.960
<i>Bring our voices together as one 
in the greatest symphony of all</i>

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.140
Th-This is...

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:01.430
<i>Do you have a dream 
(Let's fight!) in your heart?</i>

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.330
<i>Do you have (Let's fight!) 
a passionate song?</i>

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:10.470
<i>Your overflowing heat explodes</i>

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:16.000
<i>An infinite soul connecting hand in hand</i>

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:21.620
<i>Passionate Chorus Infinity</i>

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:26.560
Tachibana, are you okay?

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:27.930
I'm fine!

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:30.530
Our mission's complete, huh?

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:34.450
Yeah. They can handle the rest.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.590
Daddy! Daddy!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.790
Daddy! Daddy!

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:02.000
Good... the UN was quick to respond.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.130
Indeed.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.440
Chris-chan?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.380
What's wrong?

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:11.530
No... It's nothing.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:16.310
We're done patrolling the city!

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:19.150
Get in. We're going to HQ.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.580
The Alca-Noise that caused us so much pain...

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.870
The fragments of Alchemy...

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:34.300
I can't believe that they're being 
used by military juntas as weapons.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.990
The Bavarian Illuminati...

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:45.390
Sorry we're late!

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.180
Everybody's here? Good.

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:49.270
Let's get right to the briefing.

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.100
Senpai?

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.080
Maria, did something happen over there?

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:57.160
<i>I received a special assignment 
from Tsubasa's father.</i>

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.990
<i>So, as a S.O.N.G. agent,</i>

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:01.950
<i>I was looking into the background 
of the Magical Girl incident.</i>

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.490
<i>I wasn't told anything,</i>

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:08.640
<i>so I thought Maria was just lonely 
and followed me to England.</i>

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:10.800
<i>You know that's ridiculous!</i>

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:15.960
<i>Maria-san's investigation gave us 
the name of a certain organization.</i>

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:18.540
<i>The "Bavarian Illuminati."</i>

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:23.960
They seem to be the ones who built the 
Chateau de Tiffauges and supported Carol.

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:27.350
They've been a powerful, 
secretive force throughout history,

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:32.080
and are the reason that some call 
modern Europe the "Dark Continent."

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.630
I've seen that mark!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:37.240
Isn't that...?

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:38.700
<i>Yes.</i>

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:44.900
<i>The mysterious organization that worked 
with Mum and the Doctor to arm the FIS.</i>

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:51.590
<i>They're at the bottom of the darkness 
that we still confront today.</i>

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.750
<i>They were involved in both</i>

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:57.220
<i>the Frontier Incident and 
the Magical Girl Incident...</i>

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:59.050
<i>The Bavarian Illuminati...</i>

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:04.930
We may be able to use this to find new 
information about the Illuminati.

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:10.730
<i>We've seen hints of them, 
but never found anything definitive.</i>

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:14.950
<i>But when our investigators 
followed up on Maria-san's lead...</i>

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.150
Alca-Noise!

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:20.140
<i>This was taken</i>

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:22.710
<i>in a politically-unstable South American 
country run by a military junta.</i>

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.500
Valverde?!

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:30.030
I want the Symphogear Wielders to get to 
work as soon as they arrive on the scene.

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.550
We're going to be busy!

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:46.980
Even if S.O.N.G. works directly for the UN,

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:50.140
we're still not supposed to be 
allowed to use military force.

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:55.770
But we can't allow the use 
of heretical technology.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.900
The military usage of Alca-Noise...

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:03.640
If only we had more LiNKER,
 we could help, too...

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:05.920
But we've only got one dose left.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.660
We can't use it for just anything...

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:11.480
Don't worry!

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:15.840
You don't need the LiNKER
 or your Gears to help!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:18.540
You protected the helicopter back there!

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:19.590
Thank you!

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:22.380
I'm kind of blushing.

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.750
<i>Stare...</i>

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:28.960
I-I'm not sure where I should be looking!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:33.470
<i>Mom! Dad! Let me go! Sonya!</i>

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:34.940
<i>No, it's dangerous!</i>

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.020
Damn it!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:40.480
All these goddamn memories 
keep violating my airspace!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:44.260
A new base has been located.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.160
I'll give you your next mission.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.170
Your target is a plant that 
manufactures chemical weapons.

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:53.660
We'll go upriver and attack 
the military base there.

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:58.050
Shut it down while minimizing 
damage to the surrounding area.

00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:59.020
Roger!

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:07.190
<i>Mom! Dad!</i>

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:09.490
Mom! Dad!

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.580
Let me go, Sonya!

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:12.720
No, it's dangerous!

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.430
This is your fault, Sonya!

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.990
Remembering the past?

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:26.030
Yeah. It was a long time ago. 
Don't worry about it.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:30.270
I won't ask questions, 
but focus on the here and now.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:31.050
Otherwise...

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.830
Begin the mission!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.590
I'm heading in first!

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:50.060
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:20.170
<i>My fist is the first to strike</i>

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.520
<i>My fist charges straight forward</i>

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:23.950
<i>Keep on pushing forward</i>

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.240
<i>Keep on singing</i>

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.650
<i>Passionate Spear Justice</i>

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:33.130
<i>The justice I choose, 
the justice I found for myself</i>

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:37.600
<i>I swear I'll never let it go</i>

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:43.650
<i>Keep charging forward 
even if your voice grows hoarse</i>

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:53.500
<i>Charge forward, I'll never 
let the song in my heart die</i>

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:56.910
<i>A strike of certain love, 
protecting no matter what</i>

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:59.990
<i>Love will never lose</i>

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:02.390
<i>Gripping tight with all my power and strength</i>

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:04.660
<i>Telling my heart to hang in there</i>

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:09.950
<i>Devour the lightning and crush the thunder</i>

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:12.380
<i>A burning heart a flying heart</i>

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:18.650
<i>Fly through the sky you judged!</i>

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.640
Our forces are losing?

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:22.010
Then I'll send them to hell along with me!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:28.700
He sent out the big one?

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.990
"Everyone do your best" isn't a plan!

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:41.500
<i>The future that holds the past, 
the future that embraces me</i>

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:46.910
<i>The two of us are always together, 
and I'm always by your side</i>

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:46.240
They're attacking indiscriminately.

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:48.410
They don't care who they kill?!

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:52.290
<i>The future exists to be protected, 
bathed in sunlight</i>

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:57.700
<i>Pieces of a choice that you can't get wrong</i>

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:03.010
<i>Charge forward with the power to connect</i>

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.520
<b>Soaring Phoenix's Slash</b>

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:11.960
<i>Charge forward, I want to be 
stronger while staying myself!</i>

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.030
Hey, look!

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:08.980
If that thing hits the plant, 
it'll contaminate the whole area!

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.450
I need to do something!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:16.330
<i>A strike of certain love, 
protecting no matter what</i>

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.360
<i>Love will never lose</i>

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:21.320
<i>Gripping tight with all 
my power and strength</i>

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:23.720
<i>Telling my heart to hang in there</i>

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:29.100
<i>Devour the lightning and crush the thunder</i>

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:31.690
<i>A burning heart a flying heart</i>

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:40.770
<i>Fly through the sky you judged!</i>

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:53.330
Presidente, we've sent a dummy charter plane 
to Escalon Airport, just to be safe.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:54.740
There's no need.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:59.560
As long as what the exiled professor left us,
 Dishupine's Barrier, is active,

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:02.030
there is nowhere safer than here.

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:06.590
In other words... what you really 
want to protect is hidden here.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:08.550
Who are you?

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:12.960
We couldn't find it in your 
major military facilities.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:19.130
Our plan to bring S.O.N.G. here to reveal 
your secret garden worked well.

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:24.410
You panicked and led us straight here.

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.030
What a cute little presidente!

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:30.140
Saint Germain! Prelati! Cagliostro!

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:35.310
You're going to need to 
do one last job for us.

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.370
Who are they?

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:53.080
Alchemists sent by the Bavarian Illuminati!

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.260
The providers of heretical technology!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:03.230
The deal was that they'd protect anyone
 wearing this symbol of alliance!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:08.180
The UN is almost here! Get rid of them!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:37.880
It itches... It itches...

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:41.080
But it feels kind of good!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:53.140
73,788...

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:56.290
<i>Our agents were right.</i>

00:18:56.290 --> 00:19:00.560
<i>The area around this opera house 
can't be viewed by satellite.</i>

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:05.780
<i>Is this barrier-like thing jamming 
directed signal waveforms?</i>

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:09.160
<i>The plant attack was just 
a decoy to get us in here,</i>

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.130
<i>but I guess this is more 
than we thought it was...</i>

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.590
H-Hey!

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:28.840
Looks like the commander fled.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:31.070
Tsubasa-san, this boy...

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:34.680
I saw the factory chief fleeing by car!

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:37.660
He may have hidden in the village up ahead.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:39.110
Who are you?

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:40.980
My name's Stephan.

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:44.610
We were brought from our villages
 to this plant against our will.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:49.790
We've gotta find him before this 
turns into a huge pain in the butt.

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.030
Prepare to withdraw!

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:21.800
And after we've only just met?

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:25.180
They'll make for a perfect experiment.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:28.860
We can grant the Presidente's wish, as well.

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:32.950
We'll attach the concept of Aramitama

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:35.820
to the energy drained from the sacrifices.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:46.970
What is that?

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.920
HQ! Come in, HQ!

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.430
Tomosato-san! Fujitaka-san!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.780
The Symphogear Wielders are on a mission.

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:55.980
Lose that thing, even if it kills you!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.060
I can't lose it if it kills me!

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:01.650
Can you hear me?

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:06.480
Adjusting trajectory...

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:08.340
doing the math in my head!

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.030
We avoided it!

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:23.350
You'll bring the number to 73,794.

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:28.100
Your lives will be the building blocks 
of the world revolution.

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.210
Revolution?

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:40.330
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:21:36.340 --> 00:21:37.610
A song?

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:38.680
Where is it coming from?

00:21:54.460 --> 00:21:59.960
<b>Hell at Valverde</b>
